 features ISF certification, THX-class contrast ratios, and an ultra-quiet fanless thermal design. HDR10+ and Dolby Vision ensure reference-grade playback for the most discerning cinephiles. Available in 100\\\", 120\\\", 150\\\" and custom diagonal sizes.\", \"sku\": \"BL-HC-CP12\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/cinemaled-pro-12\", \"category\": \"home-cinema\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_cinemaled-pro-12.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 8000, \"highPrice\": 80000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/cinemaled-pro-12\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.2mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"800 nits (peak 1500 nits HDR)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the native resolution and pixel pitch of CinemaLED Pro 1.2?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 offers a true 4K UHD resolution of 3840x2160 pixels with an ultra-fine 1.2mm pixel pitch, ensuring crystal-clear image quality ideal for dedicated home theaters.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the CinemaLED Pro 1.2 and does it support HDR?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It provides a peak brightness of 1500 nits for HDR content with a standard brightness of 800 nits and supports advanced HDR formats such as HDR10+ and Dolby Vision for enhanced contrast and color performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is CinemaLED Pro 1.2 suitable for rooms with ambient light?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With 800 nits brightness and high contrast ratio of 100000:1, it performs well in controlled lighting environments typical of dedicated home theaters. However, high ambient light settings are better suited to commercial-grade displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What sizes are available and can I get a custom size?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 comes in 100\\\", 120\\\", and 150\\\" diagonal sizes, and custom sizes can be requested to perfectly fit your home theater space.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How quiet is this display during operation?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It features a fanless, zero-decibel noise design, making it ideally suited for home cinema environments where silence is crucial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are available?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers comprehensive warranty and after-sales support, typically including a 3-year limited warranty covering parts and technical support to ensure peace of mind.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does CinemaLED Pro 1.2 compare to projector-based home theaters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike projectors, CinemaLED Pro 1.2 provides consistent brightness and perfect blacks without dealing with issues like lamp replacement or ambient light interference, delivering reference-grade image quality with greater reliability.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can CinemaLED Pro 1.2 be installed in commercial screening rooms?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, its advanced color accuracy, high brightness, and tailored sizes make it excellent for private screening rooms and boutique cinemas requiring premium image fidelity.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"CinemaLED Pro 1.2\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/cinemaled-pro-12\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>CinemaLED Pro 1.2</h1><p>Discover CinemaLED Pro 1.2 for unmatched cinema LED displays in UAE. Elevate your theater experience. Contact Brightluxx Dubai today!</p><p><strong>Reference-grade MicroLED for dedicated home theaters.</strong></p><p>The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 is our flagship home cinema display, delivering true 4K resolution at 1.2mm pixel pitch with DCI-P3 color gamut coverage. Designed for dedicated screening rooms and luxury home theaters, it features ISF certification, THX-class contrast ratios, and an ultra-quiet fanless thermal design. HDR10+ and Dolby Vision ensure reference-grade playback for the most discerning cinephiles. Available in 100&quot;, 120&quot;, 150&quot; and custom diagonal sizes.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the native resolution and pixel pitch of CinemaLED Pro 1.2?</h3><p>The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 offers a true 4K UHD resolution of 3840x2160 pixels with an ultra-fine 1.2mm pixel pitch, ensuring crystal-clear image quality ideal for dedicated home theaters.</p><h3>How bright is the CinemaLED Pro 1.2 and does it support HDR?</h3><p>It provides a peak brightness of 1500 nits for HDR content with a standard brightness of 800 nits and supports advanced HDR formats such as HDR10+ and Dolby Vision for enhanced contrast and color performance.</p><h3>Is CinemaLED Pro 1.2 suitable for rooms with ambient light?</h3><p>With 800 nits brightness and high contrast ratio of 100000:1, it performs well in controlled lighting environments typical of dedicated home theaters. However, high ambient light settings are better suited to commercial-grade displays.</p><h3>What sizes are available and can I get a custom size?</h3><p>The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 comes in 100&quot;, 120&quot;, and 150&quot; diagonal sizes, and custom sizes can be requested to perfectly fit your home theater space.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"cinemaled-pro-12\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/cinemaled-pro-12\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$un