s of 800 nits and supports advanced HDR formats such as HDR10+ and Dolby Vision for enhanced contrast and color performance.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eIs CinemaLED Pro 1.2 suitable for rooms with ambient light?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWith 800 nits brightness and high contrast ratio of 100000:1, it performs well in controlled lighting environments typical of dedicated home theaters. However, high ambient light settings are better suited to commercial-grade displays.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat sizes are available and can I get a custom size?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe CinemaLED Pro 1.2 comes in 100\\u0026quot;, 120\\u0026quot;, and 150\\u0026quot; diagonal sizes, and custom sizes can be requested to perfectly fit your home theater space.\\u003c/p\\u003e14:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$15\\\"}}]\\nb:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\n8:null\\nd:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"CinemaLED Pro 1.2 - Premium LED Cinema Display in Dubai | Brightluxx\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Discover CinemaLED Pro 1.2 for unmatched cinema LED displays in UAE. Elevate your theater experience. Contact Brightluxx Dubai today!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/cinemaled-pro-12\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/ch