d_cinemaled-pro-12.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 8000, \"highPrice\": 80000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/cinemaled-pro-12\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"1.2mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"800 nits (peak 1500 nits HDR)\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta8b,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the native resolution and pixel pitch of CinemaLED Pro 1.2?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 offers a true 4K UHD resolution of 3840x2160 pixels with an ultra-fine 1.2mm pixel pitch, ensuring crystal-clear image quality ideal for dedicated home theaters.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How bright is the CinemaLED Pro 1.2 and does it support HDR?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It provides a peak brightness of 1500 nits for HDR content with a standard brightness of 800 nits and supports advanced HDR formats such as HDR10+ and Dolby Vision for enhanced contrast and color performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is CinemaLED Pro 1.2 suitable for rooms with ambient light?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With 800 nits brightness and high contrast ratio of 100000:1, it performs well in controlled lighting environments typical of dedicated home theaters. However, high ambient light settings are better suited to commercial-grade displays.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What sizes are available and can I get a custom size?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 comes in 100\\\", 120\\\", and 150\\\" diagonal sizes, and custom sizes can be requested to perfectly fit your home theater space.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How quiet is this display during operation?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It features a fanless, zero-decibel noise design, making it ideally suited for home cinema environments where silence is crucial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are available?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers comprehensive warranty and after-sales support, typically including a 3-year limited warranty covering parts and technical support to ensure peace of mind.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does CinemaLED Pro 1.2 compare to projector-based home theaters?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike projectors, CinemaLED Pro 1.2 provides consistent brightness and perfect blacks without dealing with issues like lamp replacement or ambient light interference, delivering reference-grade image quality with greater reliability.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can CinemaLED Pro 1.2 be installed in commercial screening rooms?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, its advanced color accuracy, high brightness, and tailored sizes make it excellent for private screening rooms and boutique cinemas requiring premium image fidelity.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"CinemaLED Pro 1.2\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/cinemaled-pro-12\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T71e,<h1>CinemaLED Pro 1.2</h1><p>Discover CinemaLED Pro 1.2 for unmatched cinema LED displays in UAE. Elevate your theater experience. Contact Brightluxx Dubai today!</p><p><strong>Reference-grade MicroLED for dedicated home theaters.</strong></p><p>The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 is our flagship home cinema display, delivering true 4K resolution at 1.2mm pixel pitch with DCI-P3 color gamut coverage. Designed for dedicated screening rooms and luxury home theaters, it features ISF certification, THX-class contrast ratios, and an ultra-quiet fanless thermal design. HDR10+ and Dolby Vision ensure reference-grade playback for the most discerning cinephiles. Available in 100&quot;, 120&quot;, 150&quot; and custom diagonal sizes.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the native resolution and pixel pitch of CinemaLED Pro 1.2?</h3><p>The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 offers a true 4K UHD resolution of 3840x2160 pixels with an ultra-fine 1.2mm pixel pitch, ensuring crystal-clear image quality ideal for dedicated home theaters.</p><h3>How bright is the CinemaLED Pro 1.2 and does it support HDR?</h3><p>It provides a peak brightness of 1500 nits for HDR content with a standard brightness of 800 nits and supports advanced HDR formats such as HDR10+ and Dolby Vision for enhanced contrast and color performance.</p><h3>Is CinemaLED Pro 1.2 suitable for rooms with ambient light?</h3><p>With 800 nits brightness and high contrast ratio of 100000:1, it performs well in controlled lighting environments typical of dedicated home theaters. However, high ambient light settings are better suited to commercial-grade displays.</p><h3>What sizes are available and can I get a custom size?</h3><p>The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 comes in 100&quot;, 120&quot;, and 150&quot; diagonal sizes, and custom sizes can be requested to perfectly fit your home theater space.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"CinemaLED Pro 1.2 - Premium LED Cinema Display in Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover CinemaLED Pro 1.2 for unmatched cinema LED displays in UAE. Elevate your theater experience. Contact Brightluxx Dubai today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/cinemaled-pro-12\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/cinemaled-pro-12\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4256,\"slots\":null}}}}},\"staleTime\":300,\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\"}\n","/_full":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_n