offers a true 4K UHD resolution of 3840x2160 pixels with an ultra-fine 1.2mm pixel pitch, ensuring crystal-clear image quality ideal for dedicated home theaters.</p><h3>How bright is the CinemaLED Pro 1.2 and does it support HDR?</h3><p>It provides a peak brightness of 1500 nits for HDR content with a standard brightness of 800 nits and supports advanced HDR formats such as HDR10+ and Dolby Vision for enhanced contrast and color performance.</p><h3>Is CinemaLED Pro 1.2 suitable for rooms with ambient light?</h3><p>With 800 nits brightness and high contrast ratio of 100000:1, it performs well in controlled lighting environments typical of dedicated home theaters. However, high ambient light settings are better suited to commercial-grade displays.</p><h3>What sizes are available and can I get a custom size?</h3><p>The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 comes in 100&quot;, 120&quot;, and 150&quot; diagonal sizes, and custom sizes can be requested to perfectly fit your home theater space.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"CinemaLED Pro 1.2 - Premium LED Cinema Display in Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover CinemaLED Pro 1.2 for unmatched cinema LED displays in UAE. Elevate your theater experience. Contact Brightluxx Dubai today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/cinemaled-pro-12\"}]]\n","/$c$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:T66b,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Product\", \"name\": \"CinemaLED Pro 1.2\", \"description\": \"The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 is our flagship home cinema display, delivering true 4K resolution at 1.2mm pixel pitch with DCI-P3 color gamut coverage. Designed for dedicated screening rooms a