eetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T71e,<h1>CinemaLED Pro 1.2</h1><p>Discover CinemaLED Pro 1.2 for unmatched cinema LED displays in UAE. Elevate your theater experience. Contact Brightluxx Dubai today!</p><p><strong>Reference-grade MicroLED for dedicated home theaters.</strong></p><p>The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 is our flagship home cinema display, delivering true 4K resolution at 1.2mm pixel pitch with DCI-P3 color gamut coverage. Designed for dedicated screening rooms and luxury home theaters, it features ISF certification, THX-class contrast ratios, and an ultra-quiet fanless thermal design. HDR10+ and Dolby Vision ensure reference-grade playback for the most discerning cinephiles. Available in 100&quot;, 120&quot;, 150&quot; and custom diagonal sizes.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the native resolution and pixel pitch of CinemaLED Pro 1.2?</h3><p>The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 offers a true 4K UHD resolution of 3840x2160 pixels with an ultra-fine 1.2mm pixel pitch, ensuring crystal-clear image quality ideal for dedicated home theaters.</p><h3>How bright is the CinemaLED Pro 1.2 and does it support HDR?</h3><p>It provides a peak brightness of 1500 nits for HDR content with a standard brightness of 800 nits and supports advanced HDR formats such as HDR10+ and Dolby Vision for enhanced contrast and color performance.</p><h3>Is CinemaLED Pro 1.2 suitable for rooms with ambient light?</h3><p>With 800 nits brightness and high contrast ratio of 100000:1, it performs well in controlled lighting environments typical of dedicated home theaters. However, high ambient light settings are better suited to commercial-grade displays.</p><h3>What sizes are available and can I get a custom size?</h3><p>The CinemaLED Pro 1.2 comes in 100&quot;, 120&quot;, and 150&quot; diagonal sizes, and custom sizes can be requested to perfectly fit your home theater space.</p>7:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$14\"}}]\n8:[\"$\",\"$L15\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.MetadataOutlet\",\"children\":\"$@17\"}]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L18\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$16\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"CinemaLED Pro 1.2 - Premium LED Cinema Display in Dubai | Brightluxx\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover CinemaLED Pro 1.2 for unmatched cinema LED displays in UAE. Elevate your theater experience. Contact Brightluxx Dubai today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/cinemaled-pro-12\"}]]}]}]}],null]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L1a\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{}]}]]}]\n10:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\"}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"script-0\",{\"src\":\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\",\"async\":true}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,